          "value": "Pochi, a battle dog in the apocalypse, meets a Mysterious old scientist in a village at the foot of Mt.Fuji. A spin-off of the heretical JRPG \"Metal Max\" and its latest work \"Metal Max Xeno Reborn\", which celebrates its 30th anniversary this year, is now available as a roguelike action game!",
